acle. He dishonestly focuses on ending the filibuster, claiming there's not enough votes. There is no need to end the filibuster, in fact have a filibuster and win. Enough time has passed for there to have been several actual speaking filibusters, not these fake filibusters where no one speaks.  \n  \nThen Thune has the audacity to say \"turn the SAVE America Act into a campaign issue\" and that to motivate voters \"the president needs to get out there on the campaign trail and tell them why it\u2019s important that they elect Republicans to the Senate\"  \n  \nThat strategery is vintage Republican path to defeat.    \n  \nThe country is in peril, we can not afford John Thune's deceit and sabotage. ", "author": "perma-maga", "created": 1787500575000, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Kilroy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Saboteur Thune ", "last_comment_created": 1787513037471, "content": "<p>Republicans not only fail to deliver but actively oppose an easy win on a common sense and massively popular issue.</p>\n<p>Thune is the main obstacle. He dishonestly focuses on ending the filibuster, claiming there's not enough votes. There is no need to end the filibuster, in fact have a filibuster and win. Enough time has passed for there to have been several actual speaking filibusters, not these fake filibusters where no one speaks.</p>\n<p>Then Thune has the audacity to say &quot;turn the SAVE America Act into a campaign issue&quot; and that to motivate voters &quot;the president needs to get out there on the campaign trail and tell them why it\u2019s important that they elect Republicans to the Senate&quot;</p>\n<p>That strategery is vintage Republican path to defeat.</p>\n<